{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_st04",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_st04",
  "title": "海浪照常拍岸",
  "storyCode": "DH-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c621533f0a88c7ff8b90f6c9967ed1cc8de0087f1d7723fd3cd77d38ec6bae6d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你终于醒了，D.D.D.。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了，睡完觉醒过来不是很正常的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你昨天回来之后倒头就睡，搞得我有点害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......现在外面是什么情况？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你是问城里的状况的话，和之前没什么差别，一样的喧闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去吃早饭的时候听到很多人在讨论昨天的事，但是他们也都不怎么在乎的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟事情已经被冲淡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉市长真是个厉害人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在昨天那种情况下，居然会用那样的方式......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当时在电视前也震惊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那种镇场的方式，真的是闻所未闻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且还真的有不少人去和那些危险分子战斗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当时就在旁边，那种感觉，真是太奇妙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士的不远处，是想要拼命冲过来杀掉她的危险分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而坎黛拉女士对此却不屑一顾，她只关心无人机有没有靠近游轮，能否看到船上的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她就站在那里，对着屏幕和海面指指点点，一边和旁边的人说笑着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那一刻，正在发生的一切仿佛都是不真实的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最后，那两位女侠出现了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们的出现又将一切拉回了现实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这真是......这真是太刺激了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你想创作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈，不愧是你，真了解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "经纪人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以为我们认识了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我要创作，我要将此时此刻的害怕、感激、迷茫都记录下来，作成一首歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerToken": "avg_NPC_017_3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这首歌为我自己而作，但与她们有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座城市虽然还挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莱塔尼亚的歌剧，哥伦比亚的电影，还有玻利瓦尔的咖啡，之前想要体验的东西都体验到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，这座城市里的人还真是无聊，比赛过半就不想跟他们玩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是早知道最后会变成这样，中途确认陈姐姐没事后应该和她一起上船的，这样应该能多帮上她的忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算啦，反正这座城市也差不多玩腻了，看一看陈姐姐她们会去哪里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "水月",
      "speakerToken": "avg_437_mizuki_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈姐姐来的地方，肯定也有许多和陈姐姐一样的好人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你太乱来了，诗怀雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯，哦哦哦，好好好，知道了知道了，为什么我非得被你教训不可！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在近卫局可以说就是交在你的手里，你却......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，我自己有数的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才是，明明是跑罗德岛当干员，结果却偷偷跑这里来度假！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我这是......算了，你说得也没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接着吵啊，怎么停了，老陈走了之后，你们上次吵架感觉都不知道是什么时候的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我上次去罗德岛的时候还是吵过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，总之，来都来了，事情也都解决了，我们还是把一些不愉快给忘掉，然后好好地玩一玩才是正经。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对吧，老陈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了，还在想昨天的事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。呵，这可能是我这辈子收到的最不想要的荣誉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，确实，老实说，就算是我，也觉得够膈应人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是它就是发生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老陈，世上可没有那么多两全其美和称心如意的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了行了，比起坐着聊天，不如出去购物吃大餐才能提起精神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走了，中午本小姐请客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那只死老鼠去哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她好像一大早就出去了，但是不知道去哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我大概知道，我去找她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到了记得告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，昨晚开始就躲着我，等我找到她，她死定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我离开后，这里就交给你打理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "教给你的那些没忘吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_207",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，您放一百个心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们在聊什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_207",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，是陈小姐，大姐头正在给我们训话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别跟她扯这个，小心她逮捕你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经不是警察了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可没见过你这么多管闲事的游客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先下去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赌场老板",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_207",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找我有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想，你应该不会是主动找我来喝酒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我说是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......喝一杯也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道的龙门青年创业者协会会长，是个雷厉风行，对自己和他人都很严格的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一次，算是见识到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我知道的龙门近卫局特别督察组组长，是个铁面无私，对罪犯毫不留情的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一次，也算是领教了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这次是魏彦吾让你来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
