      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我又没跑。反倒是你，你是不是脑子有病，诗怀雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你才脑子有病！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一般人会因为嫉妒朋友出去玩而自己也跟上，而且到了地方还躲着对方的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本小姐乐意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，Missy说下午要一起去购物，顺便买土特产，老陈，林小姐，饭后一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死老鼠不准不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，反正我也没什么特别的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们先去吃饭吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四位，来，稍微摆一下pose。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我忽然觉得这一幕很适合拍成照片，我来给你们拍一张，作为这次度假的纪念吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊好啊，喂，死老鼠，要拍照了，赶紧站好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，我们四个聚在一起倒也确实是难得的机会，那就拍一张吧，老陈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_206_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，三，二，一，茄子——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你在看雨霞写的有关这次多索雷斯之行的报告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "对。许久没有见到坎黛拉，这个女人看来还是老样子，疯疯癫癫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你敢说你和她不一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我和她当然不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我听派去的信使说，雨霞和小陈，这次好像做得很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "虽然不知道为什么诗怀雅家大小姐和星熊也去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "她们两个确实做得很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "但我想，她们自己不会很高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "你说坎黛拉不会害她们，我同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "但坎黛拉这个女人的善意，我恐怕她们还不知道该怎么去承受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "对这个女人来说，没有大是大非，只有结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "所以你还是拐弯抹角想说我一开始不该送小陈和雨霞过去是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "不，恰好相反，你说得对，见一见，没有坏处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "哎哟，难得你也会说些好话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "既然这样，给你看个好东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "雨霞带回来的一张照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "看，年轻真好，一个个都有活力得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我们也有过那样的时光，你还记得吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我当然记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "看到小陈过得好，我也就放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "这张照片我要去裱起来，好好收藏起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "你高兴就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "彦吾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你说，小陈还会回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "她会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
